---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT g.a FROM (SELECT a, count(*) AS n FROM u GROUP BY a) g LEFT JOIN t ON t.a = g.a AND t.b = 'x'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join LeftOuter, (a#3 == a#0)
   :- Aggregate [a#0], [a#0]
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#0]
   +- Project [a#3]
      +- Filter (b#4 == 'x')
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#3, b#4]
